{"branch":"상현점","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">상현점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-b8dcd7fa182f06af.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"상현점 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-b8dcd7fa182f06af.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>경기 용인시 수지구 만현로 120 SR프라자 4층</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 지하철</h3><ul class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-line\">신분당선</span><span>성복역</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>현대성우1차.3차.센트럴아이파크(마을)</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>수자원공사.두산위브아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>수자원공사.두산위브아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>원희캐슬.센트럴아이파크</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>센트럴아이파크.현대성우1차.3차</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">6</span><span>쌍용1차.3차아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">7</span><span>원희캐슬프라자</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">8</span><span>쌍용1차.3차아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">9</span><span>현대성우1차아파트</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 버스</h3><dl class=\"kd-buses\"><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">마을</span></dt><dd><span>5(상현지구대,금호5단지-미금역,2001아울렛)</span><span>2-1</span><span>801</span><span>82</span><span>82-1</span><span>99</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">일반</span></dt><dd><span>60-1</span><span>660</span><span>720-2</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">직행</sp